{{suffix|fi|kumpi|kin}}

===Pronunciation===
{{fi-p}}

===Pronoun===
{{head|fi|pronoun}}

# {{lb|fi|indefinite|positive polarity}} [[both]]
#: {{ux|fi|'''Kumpikin''' on punainen.|'''Both''' are red.}}
#: {{ux|fi|'''Kummatkin''' ovat punaisia.|'''Both''' are red.}}

====Usage notes====
* As seen in the example clause above, {{m|fi||kumpikin}} is in the singular, so, in order to preserve congruence, the following noun and verb must be conjugated in the singular number as well. When used attributively, the plural is mostly used with [[plurale tantum|pluralia tantum]], but also when speaking of two groups of similar objects.
{{U:fi:polarity-pair|kumpikin|kumpikaan}}

====Inflection====
* The instructive plural is mainly used as an adverb.
